<title>BANGLADESH: Chittagong port handles 18,446 tonnes of cargo.</title>
<headline>Chittagong port handles 18,446 tonnes of cargo.</headline>
<dateline>CHITTAGONG, Bangladesh 1996-11-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bangladesh's main Chittagong port handled 18,446 tonnes of export and import cargo in 24 hours ending at 0100 local/0700 GMT on Sunday compared with 9,102 tonnes in the same period on Saturday, port officials said.</p>
<p>Cargo handling in tonnes:</p>
<p>					Sunday	    Previous</p>
<p>    Export cargo		   2,436		4,000</p>
<p>    Import cargo		  16,010		5,102</p>
<p>Berthing schedule of major vessels unloading or expected to unload at Chittagong port:</p>
<p> Phosphate		13,000	Da Cheng	   24/11</p>
<p> Wheat		    25,000	Great Cheer	25/11</p>
<p> Cement		   30,000	Tian Sheng No.8  30/11</p>
<p>-- Dhaka Newsroom +880-2-506363</p>
</text>
